OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new care home set to be
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new 72-bed care home in a
OL,7,Fvillage in Leicestershire have been
OL,8,Frecommended to be approved ` but local
OL,9,FGPs warn they are already at full
OL,10,Fcapacity and will not be able to
OL,11,F"safely absorb" the extra demand.
OL,13,FCharnwood Borough Council's planning
OL,14,Fcommittee is scheduled to debate an
OL,15,Fapplication from Aspire LPP to build a
OL,16,Fnew care facility on Ratcliffe Road in
OL,17,FSileby.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
