OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new care home set to be
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe complex would include a cafe, hair
OL,7,Fand beauty salon, cinema room and 34
OL,8,Fparking spaces, and requires the
OL,9,Fdemolition of an existing two-storey
OL,10,Fdetached home, associated outbuildings
OL,11,Fand garages.
OL,13,FPlanning officers have recommended the
OL,14,Fscheme for approval, with the committee
OL,15,Fmeeting at Loughborough's Town Hall on
OL,16,F27 August.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
